# Claude Code reads CLAUDE.md. Create it locally with `ln -s AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md` rather than
# committing it: at the repo root it is also the plugin root, where plugin packaging ignores it
# and `claude plugin validate --strict` warns — failing the gate that protects the manifests
# users install.
CLAUDE.md
